%% Week 6 · UML sequence diagram of the ShopLite delivery pipeline (.github/workflows/ci.yml)
%% Every gate states its pass / fail criterion. Render: scripts/render-diagrams.sh
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub repo<br/>(branch protection)
    participant GA as Actions runner<br/>(ephemeral VM)
    participant SG as Static gates<br/>G1–G5, G7
    participant BX as Docker Buildx
    participant TV as Trivy · G6
    participant RG as GHCR registry
    participant SS as Sigstore<br/>(Fulcio + Rekor)

    Dev->>GH: git push feature branch, open PR → main
    GH->>GA: run ci.yml (pull_request) · token = contents:read
    par G1 secrets
        GA->>SG: gitleaks — full git history
        SG-->>GA: PASS 0 leaks · FAIL ≥ 1 leak
    and G2 lint
        GA->>SG: eslint · hadolint · kubeconform -strict · actionlint
        SG-->>GA: PASS 0 errors/warnings
    and G3 tests
        GA->>SG: node --test with coverage
        SG-->>GA: PASS all green, lines ≥ 80 %, branches ≥ 70 %
    and G4 SAST
        GA->>SG: semgrep (public packs + .semgrep/ project rules)
        SG-->>GA: PASS 0 ERROR/WARNING findings
    and G5 dependencies
        GA->>SG: npm audit signatures · npm audit --audit-level=high
        SG-->>GA: PASS signatures valid, 0 high/critical advisories
    and G7 IaC
        GA->>SG: trivy config (K8s YAML, Dockerfiles)
        SG-->>GA: PASS 0 HIGH/CRITICAL misconfigurations
    end

    alt any static gate failed
        GA-->>GH: check failed → merge blocked
        GH-->>Dev: logs + SARIF findings on the PR
    else all static gates passed
        loop matrix: catalog, orders, web
            GA->>BX: build --load (base image pinned by digest)
            BX-->>GA: ghcr.io/owner/shoplite-svc:sha-1a2b3c4
            GA->>TV: trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL --ignore-unfixed --exit-code 1
            alt fixable HIGH/CRITICAL CVE or embedded secret
                TV-->>GA: exit 1 → G6 FAIL (report uploaded as artifact)
            else clean
                TV-->>GA: exit 0 → G6 PASS + JSON report + CycloneDX SBOM
            end
        end
        GA-->>GH: all checks green
        GH-->>Dev: PR mergeable (1 approval + CODEOWNERS)
    end

    Dev->>GH: merge → push to main
    GH->>GA: run ci.yml (push) — G1…G7 again on the merge commit
    Note over GA,SS: G8 publish runs only for main / v* tags — never for pull requests
    GA->>RG: docker push of the image that was scanned (no rebuild)
    RG-->>GA: manifest digest sha256:…
    GA->>SS: cosign sign + cosign attest SBOM (keyless, GitHub OIDC)
    SS-->>GA: short-lived cert + Rekor transparency-log entry
    GA-->>Dev: signed, scanned image ready to deploy (by digest)
